{"server":"cn","storyId":"act12d0_level_act12d0_08_beg","groupId":"act12d0","stageId":"act12d0_08","title":"嘉维尔之拳","storyCode":"RI-8","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"af8790ddbcab67da8ac3bcef19b1b61280f968c1c8171d7eebbfa77d8ee08fa6","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的楼房跟其他部族明显不一样了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"破房子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，这里的建筑和装饰好粗糙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"不过奇怪的器械残骸到处都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"祖玛玛，你的部族建设得挺特别啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"看来他们也和你一样喜欢捣鼓机器了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"这都是我的族人们的杰作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。他们也都体会到了机械的魅力，凭借着自己的热情将这个部族建设到了现在这个样子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快看，是嘉维尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大酋长说的是真的，她要用大丑和嘉维尔再进行一次对决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么？！这怎么能错过！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，好多人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"这些人里有不少是在祭典后聚集到这里来的其他部族的人，他们也将会加入我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，所以你要说些什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔，原本如果你就那么离开的话，我不会管你。但是你既然你又站在我的面前，那么我就要在这里打倒你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你太强了，嘉维尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你还记得那一天吗，嘉维尔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"那一天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"在那天之前，我和你一样，坚信自己的拳头就是一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔胜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我又赢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，再来，下次我一定会赢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"好呀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，大地怎么在震动？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"看，是那边！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"那......那是什么啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"好大的铁块！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是萨尔贡的移动城市......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"萨尔贡是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萨尔贡是我们的国家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"移动城市又是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"移动城市就是很大的部族，在上面住着许多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也是年轻时有一次上去看到过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好了，别害怕，它不会开过来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是和我们一辈子都没关系的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"祖玛玛，你怎么了，身体不舒服吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，我先回去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_village_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我记得啊，萨尔贡的移动城市正好开过了我们这里附近嘛，从那天之后你就变得怪怪的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我反而觉得不可思议，嘉维尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"看到那样的东西，难道不会觉得惊讶吗？不会觉得震撼吗？不会觉得自己渺小吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"你问我那天的感受，那确实是觉得“哇，好大啊”，可是那和我有什么关系？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你总是这样，嘉维尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"在那天之后，我就对和你打架失去了兴趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我拜托依娜姆帮我寻找和机械有关的书籍，开始学习萨尔贡语和机械知识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"然后我遇到了大祭司，我们两个人开始一起制造大丑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"这我知道啊，我不是还去找过你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？这么说来，那边那只怪家伙就是你的隐形朋友？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没错！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，什么时候到我身边来的！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"总觉得跟大帝老板一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"大帝？你是说那只企鹅吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，咦，你认识老板吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"认识认识，当然认识，虽然我们大概有几十年没见面了，咦，是几十年吗？还是几百年？算了，反正你身上确实有那家伙的气味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"几百年是怎么回事啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"诶诶诶，没想到老板在这里还有朋友！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"原来你真的存在啊，我一直以为是祖玛玛脑子出问题了出现了幻觉，在罗德岛的时候我还专门研究过类似的病症咧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，你不知道，嘉维尔，小时候你来找祖玛玛的时候，我一直在旁边看着！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"就像这样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"消失了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，我平时是不会出现在你们的面前的，但是现在要驾驶大丑，所以就没办法啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"不过跟小家伙们一起造机器还是挺有趣的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"说到大丑，你不去驾驶真的没关系吗？我看要撞到房子了诶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？啊，我忘了！那等会儿聊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇，真的一下子又回到驾驶席了，好厉害啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"果然和老板一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，差点忘了你还在说话。不过老实说，祖玛玛，反正最后都要打一架，你说这些真的有必要吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"这些话是说给你听的，也是说给我自己听的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道吗，嘉维尔，对我来说，你是最大的阻碍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"确切地说，不是你，而是你这样的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾经试图想要说服许多人去了解机器的魅力，但是最终，他们中有绝大多数都不感兴趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"因为有你这样厉害的人在给他们做榜样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你这样的存在告诉他们，在这里，能打就能够获得想要的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你的强大，堵死了前进的道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我下定决心，我要打破人们的这种想法，我要用更强的力量，摧毁你建立起的这种对自身力量的盲目崇拜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"诶，博士，我觉得她说的蛮有道理的啊，你觉得呢？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"确实。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你到底是帮哪边的啊！"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然确实有道理，但是又好像有哪里不对......"}]},{"label":"机器不错。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"对啊，那个大家伙酷诶！"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"不过老实说，我也快要被你说服了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我也没想做大家的榜样啊，我只代表我自己，我觉得拳头可以解决一切，关别人什么事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，这不怪你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我依然决心打败你，嘉维尔，用这大丑的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人听好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"下面，大丑将和嘉维尔重新进行一次决斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"这场战斗将真正决定谁才是真正的大酋长！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司，要战斗了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，没问题！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔，准备好了吗！让你的同伴一起上也没关系！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我都已经等不及了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"你们别来插手，这一战，我要亲手打倒这个大家伙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"来吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"先试试正常功率！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"我射！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，别以为能炸到我第二次！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，不愧是嘉维尔，出色的反应神经！但是没关系，尝尝我的巨大铁拳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"拼力气？我喜欢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔，好厉害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔太厉害了！居然一个人扛住了这个大家伙的铁拳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我体检时就有过这样的疑问了，她为什么会是医疗干员啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"......虽然是敌人，但我都要忍不住为你喝彩了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"但是但是，这还没有完呢！为了应付这种情况，大丑可是有功率全开的模式的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"我按！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"那个大家伙的力气好像变得更大了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔的力量被比下去了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，多么动听的声音！......嗯？等等，表盘好像有点不对......嗯嗯嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司，情况怎么样了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，我感觉我的屁股要被烤焦了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我是问你大丑的情况！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我只是顺便说一下我的状况！我觉得是引擎功率太大，大丑开始暴走了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"感觉还挺刺激的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你先出来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"不是要战斗吗？就这么战斗吧！来吧，嘉维尔，让我就这么解决——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"大祭司！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，好吧，真遗憾，看来我需要改变策略。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大祭司","speakerId":"avg_npc_074","isRemote":false,"text":"祖玛玛，不用担心我，我来尽可能稳住它，在这个期间让大丑停下来吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘉维尔，你们先走吧，这与你们无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"说什么呢，你不是要打败我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我会打败你，但不是用这种方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，别这么见外，我当然要帮忙了，对吧，博士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"打大怪兽！我来帮忙！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"宴，可颂，做好准备战斗！","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宴","speakerId":"char_337_utage","isRemote":false,"text":"诶，要我对付这个大家伙吗？不是吧，好麻烦耶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，结束后我要收加班费哦！三倍哦！"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，别一副看热闹的样子了！准备指挥！"}]},{"label":"结果还不是要我们帮忙。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"博士我有时候觉得你的性格还挺讨人厌的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"快点准备指挥了！"}]}]}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","aliases":["嘉维尔"]},{"speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","aliases":["可颂"]},{"speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","aliases":["刻俄柏"]},{"speakerId":"char_337_utage","aliases":["宴"]},{"speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","aliases":["特米米"]},{"speakerId":"char_416_zumama","aliases":["森蚺"]}]}
